\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Selected seeds on wiki-Vote, replicate 1101 ($k=5$, $p=0.01$, $h=3$, $W=1280$, $M=10{,}000$, step coupling; 7,115 vertices and 103,689 arcs). PR uses the default tolerance. Arrows give the selection order; total spread includes the seeds and is estimated on the evaluation worlds.}}{12}{table.5}\protected@file@percent }
